  "solution": "Factor the common factor \\((2x+3)\\):\n\n\\[\n(2x+3)(x-4)+(2x+3)(x-6)=0\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(2x+3)\\bigl((x-4)+(x-6)\\bigr)=0\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(2x+3)(2x-10)=0\n\\]\n\nSet each factor equal to zero:\n\n\\[\n2x+3=0 \\implies x=-\\frac32\n\\]\n\n\\[\n2x-10=0 \\implies x=5\n\\]\n\nThe roots are \\(-\\frac32\\) and \\(5\\). Their sum is:\n\n\\[\n-\\frac32+5=-\\frac32+\\frac{10}{2}=\\frac{7}{2}\n\\]\n\nThe answer is \\(\\frac{7}{2}\\).",
